      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "The proof separates two ordered limits with different logical roles: under RH, the cutoff limit places each sufficiently small regularized function f_epsilon in B_nat, whereas the subsequent epsilon-to-zero convergence of that family to -chi uses the already identified transform and pointwise limits with a hypothesis-free domination step.",
